<title>GERMANY: Lehnkering H1 group ord. income rises.</title>
<headline>Lehnkering H1 group ord. income rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUISBERG, Germany 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    19.1    vs 16.7</p>
<p>    Group investment			   10.7    vs 14.5</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    2,215   vs 2,021</p>
<p>    Group sales				  468     vs 433</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German transport group is Lehnkering AG.</p>
</text>
